            <ArticleTitle>Will there be less need for cardiac rehabilitation programmes when acute treatment is intensified and shortened?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Will aggressive treatment of coronary heart disease change the need for rehabilitation programs in acute myocardial infarction and unstable angina? To answer this question first the aims of a rehabilitation programme will be reviewed.</AbstractText>
